Done in `2eef05c6`:

```ts
export type DuplexStream<T = Uint8Array> = {
  readable: ReadableStream<T>;
  writable: WritableStream<T>;
};
```

`connectDuplexStreams` and `readAll` are generic over the same parameter. The default keeps every existing call site unchanged — `Teleport.stream`, `TransportOptions.stream`, `Muxer.createStream()` and the hypercore bridge all still read as `DuplexStream`.

