body:
The config half is done too now, in 4760f4d4 — I said it was a follow-up; @dmaretskyi asked for it in this PR, so it is here.

```proto
/// Which path evaluates ECHO queries on the host.
enum QueryExecutor {
  UNSPECIFIED_QUERY_EXECUTOR = 0;
  MEMORY = 1;
  SQL = 2;
}

optional QueryExecutor query_executor = 18 [ (env_var) = "DX_ECHO_QUERY_EXECUTOR" ];
```

It reaches the host by the same route `enableVectorIndexing` takes: `runtimePropsFromConfig` maps the enum to the mode, the service stack threads it through `echoHostLayer` to `EchoHostLayer`, and `EchoHost` takes it as the `queryExecutor` prop it already had.

